<title>UK: UniChem buys 9 pharmacies for Moss chain.</title>
<headline>UniChem buys 9 pharmacies for Moss chain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drug wholesaler and retailer UniChem Plc said on Friday it has purchased a further nine pharmacies for its wholly owned retail chain Moss Chemists.</p>
<p>The pharmacies have a combined turnover of not less than 5.94 million stg. The total consideration will not exceed 4.07 million stg and will be met by the issue of new shares, loan notes and cash, UniChem said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Moss chain now operates in 468 locations throughout Britain.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
